be wrong\f1\emdash tragically wrong\emdash for us to take the \par
initiative in extending the war\'85 Our aim is to avoid \par
the spread of the conflict\'85 I believe that we must try \par
to limit the war to Korea for these vital reasons: To \par
make sure that the precious lives of our fighting men \par
are not wasted; to see that the security of our country \par
and the free world is not needlessly jeopardised; and \par
to prevent a third world war.\rdblquote  MacArthur had been \par
