American.\rdblquote\par
Smiling and obviously pleased, Mr. Nixon stopped and told how he had been \par
thinking, as he wrote his speech, about \ldblquote those kids out there.\rdblquote\par
\ldblquote I have seen them. They are the greatest,\rdblquote  he said. Then he contrasted them with \par
